    <bpmn:textAnnotation id="TextAnnotation_1di7pvl">
      <bpmn:text>D: SignalledAreas P: Building</bpmn:text>
    </bpmn:textAnnotation>
    <bpmn:textAnnotation id="TextAnnotation_04nok61">
      <bpmn:text>D: GatheringPoints P: Building</bpmn:text>
    </bpmn:textAnnotation>
    <bpmn:textAnnotation id="TextAnnotation_0tgyfki">
      <bpmn:text>A: SafeZones.lights := "on"</bpmn:text>
    </bpmn:textAnnotation>
    <bpmn:textAnnotation id="TextAnnotation_1iu01us">
      <bpmn:text>ENV

LOGICAL PLACES
SafeZones: danger == low OR danger == null
DangerZones: danger == high OR danger == medium
Building: amenity == university
GatheringPoints: amenity == gatheringPoint

ENV ATTRIBUTES
occupancy: current number of people in a place
danger: level of danger in a place
signalled: whether an occupant is stuck in a place
amenity: purpose of a place
lights: whether the emergency lights are on or off

SPECIAL NOTATION
count: current number of places in a logical place
myPlace: current place of a participant</bpmn:text>
    </bpmn:textAnnotation>
    <bpmn:textAnnotation id="TextAnnotation_178ix69">
      <bpmn:text>A: SafeZones.lights == "off"</bpmn:text>
    </bpmn:textAnnotation>
    <bpmn:textAnnotation id="TextAnnotation_17dqptb">
      <bpmn:text>PROCESS

SECURITY SYSTEM
Triggered when a danger is detected. Manages the emergency lights by turning them off on dangerous zones and turning them on safe ones, indicating the path to traverse. Once the building is empty, the light management stops. Once no danger is detected, all lights are shut off.

SECURITY WARDEN
Triggered when a danger is detected. Moves to areas signalled by occupants in order to rescue them and take them to a gathering point. Once there are no more signalled areas, the process ends.

OCCUPANT
Triggered when a danger is detected. Moves towards a gathering point. If the gathering point is unreachable (e.g. no safe path), the occupant signals the current place and waits for a security warden to rescue it.</bpmn:text>
    </bpmn:textAnnotation>
    <bpmn:textAnnotation id="TextAnnotation_1clvkri">
      <bpmn:text>A: MyPlace.signalled := true</bpmn:text>
    </bpmn:textAnnotation>
    <bpmn:textAnnotation id="TextAnnotation_0zjil4v">
      <bpmn:text>D: GatheringPoints
P: SafeZones</bpmn:text>
    </bpmn:textAnnotation>
